# Dashboard App (`apps/dashboard`)

## Directory Structure

```
apps/dashboard/src/
  app/(dashboard)/        # authenticated routes
  app/(onboarding)/       # onboarding flow
  app/login/
  components/
    app/                  # feature-specific (prefixed dashboard-{feature}-{role})
    layout/               # page wrappers, nav, providers
    shared/               # truly reusable (empty-state, error-state, page-loader)
  hooks/
    mutations/            # use-{action}.ts
    queries/              # use-{resource}.ts
  stores/                 # Zustand stores
  lib/                    # orpc client, query-keys, utils, auth-client
```

## Component Conventions

- File: `dashboard-{feature}-{role}.tsx` (kebab-case)
- Export: `PascalCase` matching the filename
- Always co-locate a skeleton: `export function DashboardXyzSkeleton() { ... }`
- Extract inline components out of page files into `components/app/`

## Data Fetching

- Server state: TanStack Query v5 via `orpc` client
- Queries: `useQuery(orpc.{router}.{method}.queryOptions())`
- Mutations: `useMutation(orpc.{router}.{method}.mutationOptions({ onSuccess, onError }))`
- Invalidate via `queryKeys.*` from `@/lib/query-keys`

## Client State

- Global UI state in Zustand (`useDashboardUI`) — selected IDs, drawer open state, active run
- No `useState` for cross-component state — use the Zustand store

## Toast Conventions

- `toast.error()` for failures
- No `toast.success()` on pipeline launch (drawer opening is feedback enough)
- Error toasts always provide a "Copy" action for the error message

## Navigation

- Routes defined in `@harmonia/common/utils/routes` as `DASHBOARD_ROUTES`
- Use `Link` from `next/link` for all navigation — no `window.location.href` except hard redirects
